short_label: XI.17
---
sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If two straight lines are cut by parallel planes, then they are cut in the same ratios.
----
proof:

Let the two straight lines *AB* and *CD* be cut by the parallel planes *GH, KL,* and *MN* at the points *A, E,* and *B,* and at the points *C, F,* and *D,* respectively.

<figure class="diagram">
